tch】 Wi-Fi6ルーターをWi-Fi6シェーバーと誤記で、NTT-Xが謝罪","id":1,"title":"【やじうまPC Watch】 Wi-Fi6ルーターをWi-Fi6シェーバーと誤記で、NTT-Xが謝罪","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/yajiuma/1343677.html","text":"　NTT-X Storeマガジンが8月11日付けで発行したメールマガジンにおいて「Wi-Fi 6 ルーター」を「Wi-Fi6シェーバー」と誤表記をしていたとして、12日付けのメールマガジンにて「お客様の混乱を招いてしまいましたこと、謹んで深くお詫び申し上げます」と謝罪している。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1343/677/01.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1628771926,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/yajiuma/1343677.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/yajiuma/1343677.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=JXY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cd0d303-5ae1-44ff-8403-5d24701d5a12","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"世の中にはペーパーフィルターを使った氷出し珈琲という淹れ方もあるらしいですぞ。\n\n\u003chttps://www.ejcra.org/column/ca_140.html\u003e","ts":"1628811148.051800","thread_ts":"1628804589.050500","attachments":[{"fallback":"全日本コーヒー商工組合連合会: 氷出しコーヒーはコクがあるのにスッキリ？美味しさの秘密や作り方を学ぼう","id":1,"title":"氷出しコーヒーはコクがあるのにスッキリ？美味しさの秘密や作り方を学ぼう","title_link":"https://www.ejcra.org/column/ca_140.html","text":"氷出しコーヒーは、氷が溶けた水で淹れるアイスコーヒーのこと。氷を温めて溶かすのではなく、自然に溶かしながらゆっくりとコーヒーを淹れます。抽出に時間がかかりますが、雑味の少ないまろやかな味わいが特長です。この記事では、氷出しコーヒーの基本的な情報や水出しコーヒーとの違い、美味しく作るコツなどを紹介します。","image_url":"https://www.ejcra.org/column/fdvulm00000027y8-img/gazou1.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"全日本コーヒー商工組合連合会","service_icon":"https://www.ejcra.org/assets/image/apple-touch-icon-180x180.png","from_url":"https://www.ejcra.org/column/ca_140.html","original_url":"https://www.ejcra.org/column/ca_140.html"}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kKxSU"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"033ce09a-87de-474a-8e33-c2890e9b9c9c","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ハリオのもう少し小さめのポットを買ったけど、最終的にポットはそのまま使ってストレーナーを使わずにお茶パックで水出しコーヒーを作るようになった。単に片付けが面倒だったので。その代わりに淹れるときが面倒に。","ts":"1628804589.050500","thread_ts":"1628804589.050500","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1628804684.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oly6U"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"c31e065c-27c6-4799-b4f9-b6c33f3828bd","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"お茶パックって文字が最初に目に入る→（天才かよ…）→文末がちゃんとオチになってることに気づく→（…ままならねえな）","ts":"1628810746.051500","thread_ts":"1628804589.050500","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NRw"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"033ce09a-87de-474a-8e33-c2890e9b9c9c","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ハリオのもう少し小さめのポットを買ったけど、最終的にポットはそのまま使ってストレーナーを使わずにお茶パックで水出しコーヒーを作るようになった。単に片付けが面倒だったので。その代わりに淹れるときが面倒に。","ts":"1628804589.050500","thread_ts":"1628804589.050500","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1628804684.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oly6U"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"fb1ccb18-ed4c-4aba-83e2-7eabc562cc35","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ユーモラスだ。","ts":"1628809979.051400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+zGgQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1c8c14e-c867-40c3-95f5-08082e567bea","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"前衛芸術","ts":"1628809930.051200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EFg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46824b02-3590-4044-9871-d9697c6a553e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/LfXAMDg4PE50i9e/status/1425691667072307202?s=19|https://twitter.com/LfXAMDg4PE50i9e/status/1425691667072307202?s=19\u003e","ts":"1628809773.050900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/LfXAMDg4PE50i9e|@LfXAMDg4PE50i9e\u003e: リモートワークじゃお仕事